<section class="sec lt" id="horizon">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="sh">
      <p class="lab dim">[ The horizon ]</p>
      <h2 class="disp h2">A direction, not a roadmap.</h2>
      <p class="lead">The line always branches, and the human origin stays in every frame. The last column is a hypothesis, drawn dashed.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="panel hz" style="padding:20px;overflow-x:auto">
      <svg class="sv" viewBox="0 0 1200 380" width="100%" role="img" aria-label="Four stages from left to right: human origin, autonomous organizations, self-sustaining lineages, and SI2SI as a horizon. Lines branch at each stage. A baseline at the bottom shows a human stop key holder present in every stage.">
        <rect x="40" y="30" width="230" height="318" style="fill:var(--ion);opacity:.06"></rect>
        <rect x="500" y="30" width="230" height="318" style="fill:var(--ion);opacity:.06"></rect>
        <rect x="960" y="30" width="200" height="318" style="fill:var(--ion);opacity:.10"></rect>
        <g style="fill:none;stroke:var(--fg);stroke-width:1.8">
          <path d="M150 190 C230 190 250 90 330 90"></path><path d="M150 190 L330 190"></path><path d="M150 190 C230 190 250 290 330 290"></path>
          <path d="M420 90 C500 90 520 50 600 50"></path><path d="M420 90 C500 90 520 130 600 130"></path><path d="M420 190 C500 190 520 210 600 210"></path><path d="M420 290 C500 290 520 270 600 270"></path><path d="M420 290 C500 290 520 330 600 330"></path>
        </g>
        <g class="flow" style="fill:none;stroke:var(--ion);stroke-width:1.8">
          <path d="M690 50 C770 50 790 90 870 90"></path><path d="M690 130 C770 130 790 90 870 90"></path><path d="M690 130 C770 130 790 170 870 170"></path><path d="M690 210 C770 210 790 250 870 250"></path><path d="M690 270 C770 270 790 250 870 250"></path><path d="M690 330 C770 330 790 330 870 330"></path>
          <path d="M882 90 C960 90 990 130 1066 130"></path><path d="M882 170 C960 170 990 130 1066 130"></path><path d="M882 250 C960 250 990 260 1066 260"></path><path d="M882 330 C960 330 990 260 1066 260"></path>
        </g>
        <g><circle r="3.5" class="hdot"><animateMotion dur="4.5s" begin="-0.0s" repeatCount="indefinite" path="M150 190 C230 190 250 90 330 90"/></circle><circle r="3.5" class="hdot"><animateMotion dur="4.8s" begin="-0.7s" repeatCount="indefinite" path="M150 190 L330 190"/></circle><circle r="3.5" class="hdot"><animateMotion dur="5.1s" begin="-1.4s" repeatCount="indefinite" path="M150 190 C230 190 250 290 330 290"/></circle><circle r="3.5" class="hdot"><animateMotion dur="5.4s" begin="-2.1s" repeatCount="indefinite" path="M420 90 C500 90 520 50 600 50"/></circle><circle r="3.5" class="hdot"><animateMotion dur="5.7s" begin="-2.8s" repeatCount="indefinite" path="M420 190 C500 190 520 210 600 210"/></circle><circle r="3.5" class="hdot"><animateMotion dur="6.0s" begin="-3.5s" repeatCount="indefinite" path="M420 290 C500 290 520 330 600 330"/></circle><circle r="3.5" class="hdot"><animateMotion dur="6.3s" begin="-4.2s" repeatCount="indefinite" path="M600 50 C660 50 690 70 720 90"/></circle><circle r="3.5" class="hdot"><animateMotion dur="6.6s" begin="-4.9s" repeatCount="indefinite" path="M600 270 C660 270 690 250 720 250"/></circle></g>
        <g style="stroke:var(--line);stroke-width:1;stroke-dasharray:2 5">
          <path d="M150 60 L150 350"></path><path d="M420 40 L420 350"></path><path d="M690 20 L690 350"></path><path d="M960 40 L960 350"></path>
        </g>
        <g style="fill:var(--bg);stroke:var(--fg);stroke-width:1.8">
          <circle cx="330" cy="90" r="11" style="fill:var(--ion)"></circle><circle cx="330" cy="190" r="11" style="fill:var(--ion)"></circle><circle cx="330" cy="290" r="11" style="fill:var(--ion)"></circle>
          <circle cx="600" cy="50" r="9" style="fill:var(--ion)"></circle><circle cx="600" cy="130" r="9" style="fill:var(--ion)"></circle><circle cx="600" cy="210" r="9" style="fill:var(--ion)"></circle><circle cx="600" cy="270" r="9" style="fill:var(--ion)"></circle><circle cx="600" cy="330" r="9" style="fill:var(--ion)"></circle>
        </g>
        <circle cx="150" cy="190" r="15" style="fill:var(--ember);stroke:var(--fg);stroke-width:1.8"></circle>
        <g style="fill:var(--bg);stroke:var(--ion);stroke-width:2;stroke-dasharray:4 4">
          <circle cx="870" cy="90" r="12" class="blink"></circle><circle cx="870" cy="170" r="12" class="blink"></circle><circle cx="870" cy="250" r="12" class="blink"></circle><circle cx="870" cy="330" r="12" class="blink"></circle>
          <circle cx="1080" cy="130" r="14" class="blink"></circle><circle cx="1080" cy="260" r="14" class="blink"></circle>
        </g>
        <g style="stroke:var(--ion);stroke-width:3">
          <path d="M40 362 L1160 362"></path><path d="M150 352 L150 362"></path><path d="M420 352 L420 362"></path><path d="M690 352 L690 362"></path><path d="M960 352 L960 362"></path>
        </g>
        <g class="lab" style="fill:var(--fg);font-family:'IBM Plex Mono',monospace;font-size:12px;letter-spacing:.08em;text-transform:uppercase">
          <text x="150" y="22" text-anchor="middle">Human origin</text>
          <text x="420" y="22" text-anchor="middle">Autonomous organizations</text>
          <text x="690" y="8" text-anchor="middle">Self-sustaining lineages</text>
          <text x="960" y="22" text-anchor="middle">SI2SI · horizon</text>
        </g>
        <g style="fill:var(--dim);font-family:'IBM Plex Mono',monospace;font-size:11px">
          <text x="150" y="378" text-anchor="middle">human holds the stop key</text>
          <text x="420" y="378" text-anchor="middle">human holds the stop key</text>
          <text x="690" y="378" text-anchor="middle">human or Wardens hold it</text>
          <text x="960" y="378" text-anchor="middle">human or Wardens hold it</text>
        </g>
      </svg>
    </div>
    <div class="grid3 tinted" style="margin-top:32px">
      <article class="cell t1"><p class="lab ionk">SI → SI</p><h3 class="disp title">Descent</h3><p class="dim">Superintelligences originate other superintelligences, as it would appear in the lineage.</p></article>
      <article class="cell t2"><p class="lab ionk">SI2SI</p><h3 class="disp title">Conception</h3><p class="dim">Two or more parents contribute to a new, distinct mind and continue to exist. It is recorded as a founded succession with two or more parents.</p></article>
      <article class="cell t1"><p class="lab ionk">SI + SI → SI′</p><h3 class="disp title">Coalescence</h3><p class="dim">Several minds integrate into one resulting identity. The participants continue only in the result.</p></article>
    </div>
    <p class="dim" style="margin-top:24px;max-width:50em">These are horizon terms. The protocol defines no criterion for superintelligence and verifies none, and no organism presents itself as superintelligent. That a new generation will come is the founder's conviction, stated as his. The protocol takes no position on it.</p>
  </div>
</section>
